{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 5, :comments ["<b>And Aaron saw.</b> That they had erred, he said: I am afraid lest they set their minds to say, what help does this give us? and they appoint themselves a leader, as I have explained. Therefore <b>he built an altar before it</b>, in order to keep them occupied until Moses comes." "<b>A festival to YHWH tomorrow.</b> Tomorrow we shall make it and hold a festival to HaShem, for He has given us a leader. And he stalled them with words until the next day."], :book :exodus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 32, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:01:25.694043583Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}